This license governs the KCC framework starting from version 1.0.0 and
applies to all subsequent versions unless a future version explicitly
supersedes it. The current published version is 1.2.0.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The KCC (Kernel · Capabilities · Cells) operating model, the .KCC
framework layout, the agent contract surfaces, the lifecycle, the
protocol set (including but not limited to: cells, workspace,
sandbox-runtime, deployment, accuracy-calibration,
architecture-documentation, progress-tracking, lethal-trifecta,
spec-layout, idea-layout, trace-layout, auto-mode, confidence-gate,
obsidian-standard, adaptation-guide, token-budget, solution-onboarding,
architecture-governance), the dialect family pattern, the phase model,
the inspector pipeline design, and all original written content in this
repository remain the intellectual property of Tarek Fawaz and
tikasway.dev.

