   non-exclusive, perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free license to use,
   distribute, and incorporate their contributions under the terms of
   this License, including the right to relicense the combined Work
   under updated license terms in future major releases.

6. CELL TEAM AUTONOMY

   Cell teams (delivery teams using a generated cell) may add their own
   capabilities, scripts, configurations, and documentation under
   `<cell>/local/` without those additions being subject to this
   License's attribution clause for the team's internal use, provided
   they do not redistribute their `local/` additions publicly. Public
   redistribution of `local/` additions is subject to the same
   attribution requirements as the rest of the Work.

7. PIPELINE TEMPLATES AND IaC STUBS

   Pipeline templates contributed under
   `.KCC/kernel/templates/pipelines/` and IaC stubs produced by the
   `infrastructure-implementer` agent are licensed under the same terms
   as the rest of the Work. Generated pipelines and IaC files in a
   downstream cell's `.github/workflows/`, `azure-pipelines/`, or
   `infrastructure/` directories are considered derivative works of the
   templates and must carry the attribution line above in their own
   header comment.

