OTHER DEALINGS IN THE WORK.

This explicitly includes (but is not limited to):

- AI agent outputs produced by capabilities defined in this framework
  (Tarek Fawaz · tikasway.dev is not responsible for the correctness,
  safety, or legal compliance of code, decisions, or artifacts produced
  by agents you run under KCC).
- Token costs incurred by running agents (Token Guard provides
  estimates; actual costs depend on the model provider and may differ).
- Deployment outcomes from pipeline templates or IaC stubs produced by
